<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Home Properties started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Home Properties started.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said it initiated coverage of Home Properties of New York Inc with a buy rating and set a 12-month price target of $25.</p>
<p>-- said believes stock should trade at a premium to its peer group due to its low-risk profile and attractive growth rate and yield.</p>
<p>-- Home Properties lost 5/16 to 22-1/16.</p>
</text>
